{"4621810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Livin' the Cream: Ice Cream Simulator","steam_appid":4621810,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5100290],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4621810\/extras\/4a78e3e20515fc5b2794d79dd93055d5.avif?t=1793708193\" width=1313 height=258 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>smooth, satisfying flow of ice cream<\/strong> in real time. Play in two dedicated modes:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong>: Enjoy a time management challenge as the business day goes on and you need to complete all your planned tasks.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy<\/strong>: Play at your own pace without the need to worry about the passing time, prep ice cream and buy ingredients as long as you want until you're ready to open shop again.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4621810\/extras\/e94f3b73ceb39a3e23ac8a134036edcd.poster.avif?t=1793708193\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4621810\/extras\/e94f3b73ceb39a3e23ac8a134036edcd.webm?t=1793708193\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4621810\/extras\/e94f3b73ceb39a3e23ac8a134036edcd.mp4?t=1793708193\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4621810\/extras\/fb04f0a9b9f3d8560a45119ddaa97a7d.avif?t=1793708193\" w